WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.337
I'm in the Arctic Circle and the 
big question for me is, "Why?"

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:08.216
The great outdoors
means different things

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.884
to different people.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:14.431
I'm more the great indoors
type of guy.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:19.352
But I've agreed to explore what
lies outside my comfort zone.

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:24.399
A world I've spent
my whole life avoiding.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.400
Woah, woah, woah.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.527
- Beautiful mountain.
- That's a volcano.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.528
That's a volcano?

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:30.780
I think I'm feeling a
heart attack coming on.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:34.367
I'm not entirely sure what
I signed up for.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.911
But what's the worst
that can happen?

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.329
Oh, my god.

00:00:38.621 --> 00:00:40.457
First time I've had my
hand up an elephant's...

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.291
 [elephant trumpets]

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.586
I like to avoid violence at all cost.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.297
How you doing over there?

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.508
Not bad, I'll be opening
my eyes momentarily.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:51.718
Just surviving...

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:54.679
would be great.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.435
- You need some help?
- No, I got it.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.023
There is a world outside the resort.

00:01:06.357 --> 00:01:08.610
We always try to find the positive way.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.986
- Pura vida!
- Pura vida!

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:11.112
Woah!

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:12.864
It's about what's really important:

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.115
nature,

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.076
family,

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.286
the friends that I met.

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.246
I'm going for it.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.414
Let the screaming begin.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:24.501
Oh, my god. 
Oh, my god. 
Oh, my god.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.465
This is the last time I have
five vodkas with a Finn.

